WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.047
Open the Command Palette and choose Osprey: Manage Packages.

00:12.683 --> 00:19.681
Browse registry shows the available Osprey packages. Scroll through the catalog, or filter it by package name.

00:28.883 --> 00:37.052
Select a package to inspect its release and security findings. Unverified means there is no authenticated audit evidence.

00:44.683 --> 00:51.423
Choose Add to project. The registry is unverified, so the panel asks you to confirm before it changes anything.

01:00.517 --> 01:07.363
Switch to Installed to see the new dependency. To remove it, select it, choose Remove dependency, and confirm.

01:24.517 --> 01:31.696
The Installed view updates to show the remaining dependencies. Add and remove packages without leaving VS Code.
